{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>The proverbs of Solomon:</b> <b>A wise son gladdens a father</b> — because he recognizes his wisdom." "<b>The grief of his mother</b> — because the fool always stays at home and the mother worries about him, or because he mentioned the father he mentioned the mother."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:46.860108515Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}